          <title>Incredibly real No Rarity Charizard Fake &amp; Masaki Alakazam Fake Cards</title>
          <dc:creator><![CDATA[charizardespana]]></dc:creator>
          <category>General</category>
          <description><![CDATA[
            <p>Recently it has come to my attention of several very good fakes circulating the secondary market and duping a lot of people (including some prominent japanese buyers/collectors).</p>
<p>One person has at least lost $10k to this already.</p>
<p>They are scary good fakes but have some minor details that you can look for.</p>
<p>I won’t share where or who is making and selling them, as I don’t want to promote them.</p>
<p>First up, No Rarity Charizard:</p>
<p>Fake card popped up in <img src="https://efour.b-cdn.net/uploads/default/optimized/4X/3/5/6/3568624a934c30bcb614e03be01481d2fe02b20d_2_322x485.jpeg" alt="Screenshot_20260920-212749" data-base62-sha1="7CsWKfDkcl52mtq17LPqH9nfBsp" width="322" height="485" srcset="https://efour.b-cdn.net/uploads/default/optimized/4X/3/5/6/3568624a934c30bcb614e03be01481d2fe02b20d_2_322x485.jpeg, https://efour.b-cdn.net/uploads/default/optimized/4X/3/5/6/3568624a934c30bcb614e03be01481d2fe02b20d_2_483x727.jpeg 1.5x, https://efour.b-cdn.net/uploads/default/optimized/4X/3/5/6/3568624a934c30bcb614e03be01481d2fe02b20d_2_644x970.jpeg 2x" data-dominant-color="9B7D62">]]></description>
