    <item>
          <title>Joined the dark side today</title>
          <dc:creator><![CDATA[ArcticLapras]]></dc:creator>
          <category>Market</category>
          <description><![CDATA[
            <p>So, usually I buy cards because I like them, and, sometimes, because they seem like a good investment too.</p>
<p>With this card, it’s almost purely because it seems like a great buy, a PSA 10 Gold Star although I do like the card as well.</p>
<p>One of the weird things about it though is that it comes from a reprint set, featuring the ugly Pikachu head, yet is a unique card, unlike, for instance, the Umbreon. I’m not sure if I consider it a real Gold Star, even though it clearly<img src="https://efour.b-cdn.net/uploads/default/optimized/4X/0/a/c/0ac8c3396f8e459c11ad5fd192883406c0823f77_2_363x485.jpeg" alt="17896589886753505284034281180377" data-base62-sha1="1xoUcTBifcAFmkARQ0bwRuEgxD1" width="363" height="485" srcset="https://efour.b-cdn.net/uploads/default/optimized/4X/0/a/c/0ac8c3396f8e459c11ad5fd192883406c0823f77_2_363x485.jpeg, https://efour.b-cdn.net/uploads/default/optimized/4X/0/a/c/0ac8c3396f8e459c11ad5fd192883406c0823f77_2_544x727.jpeg 1.5x, https://efour.b-cdn.net/uploads/default/optimized/4X/0/a/c/0ac8c3396f8e459c11ad5fd192883406c0823f77_2_726x970.jpeg 2x" data-dominant-color="9A9391">]]></description>
